{"id":"n31508-1-13","stage":2,"title":"한국말 · 韩国语","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31508-1-13-1","ko":"아이들은 외국에서 잘 지내고 있어?","zh":"孩子们在国外过得还好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이들은","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이들은","audio":"/audio/3202941d9082bdf0aea2.mp3"}},{"text":"외국에서","meaning":"外国","explanation":"외국：外国；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"외국","audio":"/audio/6ea4544c8e190594b679.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68121","senseId":"1","lemma":"외국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"외국에서","audio":"/audio/26338cd3989605b3935e.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"지내고","meaning":"度日，生活","explanation":"지내다：度日，生活；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"1","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지내고","audio":"/audio/105243a4d294469934cc.mp3"}},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"6ea4544c8e190594","term":"외국","zh":"外国","audio":"/audio/6ea4544c8e190594b679.mp3","entryId":"68121","definition":"本国以外的国家。","pronunciation":["외ː국","웨ː국"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"度日，生活","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"以某种程度或状态过日子。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/9ed598442d54894416a5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31508-1-13-2","ko":"응. 그런데 한국말을 많이 잊어버린 거 같아서 걱정이야.","zh":"嗯。不过他们好像把韩语忘得差不多了，我很担心。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"그런데","meaning":"可是，可","explanation":"그런데：可是，可","readings":[{"term":"그런데","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70717","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런데","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3"}},{"text":"한국말을","meaning":"韩国语，韩语","explanation":"한국말：韩国语，韩语；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"한국말","audio":"/audio/62cdab605f961acc9011.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31508","senseId":"1","lemma":"한국말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한국말을","audio":"/audio/1b1528bd9c918189699e.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"잊어버린","meaning":"忘掉","explanation":"잊어버리다：忘掉；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"잊어버리다","audio":"/audio/5a16c9c25daf9c4e4c13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89801","senseId":"1","lemma":"잊어버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잊어버린","audio":"/audio/f137956e2b6457b82df6.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"같아서","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아서","audio":"/audio/a38b450f1fcf31c027d2.mp3"}},{"text":"걱정이야.","meaning":"担心，忧虑，担忧","explanation":"걱정：担心，忧虑，担忧；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"걱정","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17232","senseId":"1","lemma":"걱정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걱정이야","audio":"/audio/ed46696e57806e649a87.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"30c94182141ace2f","term":"그런데","zh":"可是，可","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3","entryId":"70717","definition":"用于将话题与前面内容相连接的同时，又将话头转向其他方向。","pronunciation":["그런데"]},{"id":"62cdab605f961acc","term":"한국말","zh":"韩国语，韩语","audio":"/audio/62cdab605f961acc9011.mp3","entryId":"31508","definition":"韩国使用的语言。","pronunciation":["한ː궁말"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"5a16c9c25daf9c4e","term":"잊어버리다","zh":"忘掉","audio":"/audio/5a16c9c25daf9c4e4c13.mp3","entryId":"89801","definition":"本来知道的事情记不住或记不起来。","pronunciation":["이저버리다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"7582493f75565a84","term":"걱정","zh":"担心，忧虑，担忧","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3","entryId":"17232","definition":"害怕发生不好的事情而感到不安。","pronunciation":["걱쩡"]}],"audio":"/audio/d5acfd89ebbe55dc5c5b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.552,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=31508","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":87,"sequenceScore":2.3787,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯。不过他们好像把韩语忘得差不多了，我很担心。","孩子们在国外过得还好吗？","这张照片里全家人都拍得很好呢。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["孩子们在国外过得还好吗？","这张照片里全家人都拍得很好呢。","嗯。不过他们好像把韩语忘得差不多了，我很担心。"],"answer":2}]}
